<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Rebel first half net profit soars.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Rebel first half net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sporting goods retailer Rebel Sport Ltd said on Monday its net profit in the 1996/97 first half rose by 105 percent to A$674,000 and it had increased the dividend payment to 1.75 cents per share from 1.5 cents a year ago.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that sales rose 28.2 percent to A$60.51 million in the first half ended September 30 and operating profit rose 90.3 percent to A$984,000.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
